"app.whatsNew.summary" = "Fixes for settings that could reset, shortcuts that could stop working, and windows that could end up partly off screen. Spectacle 2 also comes in Russian now.";
"app.whatsNew.added1" = "Russian. Choose Русский in Settings › General › Language.";
"app.whatsNew.fixed1" = "Changing a General setting and then opening Shortcuts could reset your General settings, and recording a shortcut could reset them again. The two are now saved separately, and settings from an earlier version are sorted out the first time 2.6.0 starts.";
"app.whatsNew.fixed2" = "A shortcut you cleared with Delete came back after a restart. It now stays cleared.";
"app.whatsNew.fixed3" = "Choosing About Spectacle 2 or Check for Updates from the menu while recording a shortcut turned every shortcut off until you reopened the Shortcuts pane. Clicking Restore Defaults while recording turned them back on too early, so the keys you pressed moved a window instead of being recorded. Both are fixed.";
"app.whatsNew.fixed4" = "Windows could end up partly off screen after Make Larger, after Center on a window bigger than the screen, or when an app refused the size Spectacle asked for. Spectacle now checks where the window landed and moves it back on screen, for keyboard shortcuts and drag-to-snap alike.";
"app.whatsNew.fixed5" = "Terminal and other apps that size windows in steps no longer overlap the window next to them. Spectacle shrinks a window that comes out bigger than its space, as the original Spectacle did.";
"app.whatsNew.fixed6" = "With window gaps and Skip gap at the top edge both on, pressing a half or corner shortcut again cycles through ½, ⅔ and ⅓ as it should, and windows stacked top and bottom keep a full gap between them. The margin around tiled windows is now the same on every side.";
"app.whatsNew.changed1" = "Windows dragged to a screen edge now snap to exactly the same places as the keyboard shortcuts. On some screen sizes a few positions move by 1 or 2 points, and a window that can't be resized is centred in its space instead of sitting in a corner.";
"app.whatsNew.changed2" = "Updated to DragonKit 4.2.0, the shared framework behind Settings, About, What's New and updates. It is what adds Russian.";
